+
+		/**
+		* Value to be loaded into SDRAM EMR registers.
+		*
+		* Required value:
+		* Bitwise OR of the following:
+		* - AL_DDR_JEDEC_DDR3_MR1_DE_EN or AL_DDR_JEDEC_DDR3_MR1_DE_DIS -
