+
+/**
+ * Exit Power Down with DLL on to any valid command; Exit Precharge
+ * Power Down with DLL frozen to commands not requiring a locked DLL
+ *
+ * Required value: According to the following JEDEC table:
+ *                    DDR freq | t_xp
