+
+/**
+ * MAC media mode
+ *
+ * +---------------------+----+----+----+----+
+ * | Mode \ MAC version  | v1 | v2 | v3 | v4 |
+ * +---------------------+----+----+----+----+
+ * | RGMII               | v  | v  |    |    |
+ * +---------------------+----+----+----+----+
+ * | SGMII               | v  | v  | v  |    |
+ * +---------------------+----+----+----+----+
+ * | SGMII_2_5G          | v  | v  | v  |    |
+ * +---------------------+----+----+----+----+
+ * | 10GbE_Serial        | v  | v  | v  | v  |
+ * +---------------------+----+----+----+----+
+ * | 10G_SGMII           | v  | v  |    |    |
+ * +---------------------+----+----+----+----+
+ * | XLG_LL_40G          |    |    | v  | v  |
+ * +---------------------+----+----+----+----+
+ * | KR_LL_25G           |    |    | v  |    |
+ * +---------------------+----+----+----+----+
