+
+	/**
+	 * read mdio register
+	 * this function uses polling mode, and as the mdio is slow interface, it might
+	 * block the cpu for long time (milliseconds).
+	 * @param adapter pointer to the private structure
+	 * @param phy_addr address of mdio phy
